{"pageid":3816,"title":"Skeleton King","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Skeleton King</span>","revid":17165,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Skeleton King</b> is a unique \"Boss\" Enemy found exclusively in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>. He has an arena on the opposite side of the island and will drop the <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Crown\" title=\"Acid Crown\">Acid Crown</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/BIG_Bone\" title=\"BIG Bone\">Big Bones</a> when defeated.\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-Character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Skeleton King</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Skeleton_Kings.png/revision/latest?cb=20250209171832\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Skeleton Kings\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Skeleton_Kings.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250209171832\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Skeleton_Kings.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250209171832 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d6/Skeleton_Kings.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250209171832 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Skeleton Kings\" width=\"270\" height=\"235\" data-image-key=\"Skeleton_Kings.png\" data-image-name=\"Skeleton Kings.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Physical description</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton\" title=\"Skeleton\">Skeleton</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"appearsin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Appears in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Acidlands</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tips: </b>\n</p><p>You can get a vehicle into the arena to push the King out, this is useful to reduce enemy swarming.\n</p><p>You can get the King sitting in a vehicle, which will prevent it from moving (In latest versions, he is capable of \"jumping\" out).\n</p><p>You can stand on the other side of a vehicle, and he won't be able to hit you, while you can still hit him.\nYou can stand on one of the nearby pillars and shoot at him from range.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><b>Trivia:</b>\n</p><p>The Skeleton King can also drop a \"<a href=\"/wiki/Ribmaul\" title=\"Ribmaul\">Ribmaul</a>\", roughly 20% of the time. \n</p><p>The Skeleton King can also drop a \"<a href=\"/wiki/BIG_Skull\" title=\"BIG Skull\">BIG Skull</a>\", roughly 10% of the time.\n</p><p>There can sometimes be two Kings at once.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830133652\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 62/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   18.105  